{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.H2AlgebraDimension","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.H2AlgebraDimension","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.AdjoinRoot","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.PowerBasis"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_finrank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_finrank","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2AlgebraDimension.lean#L58-L64","doc":"**`dim_K H_2(q) = 2 = 2!` (sorry-free).**  The `n = 2` instance of\n`dim H_n(q) = n!` (brick `qou-lrz1`): the Iwahori–Hecke algebra\n`H_2(q) = K[σ]/(σ²-(q-1)σ-q)` is `2`-dimensional, spanned by the\n`T_w` basis `{T_e, T_{s}} = {1, σ}` indexed by `S_2 = {e, s}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_finiteDimensional","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_finiteDimensional","kind":"instance","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2AlgebraDimension.lean#L52-L56","doc":"**`H_2(q)` is finite-dimensional over `K` (sorry-free).**  The\ninstance the semisimplicity hooks require of the carrier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2PowerBasis_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2PowerBasis_dim","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2AlgebraDimension.lean#L48-L50","doc":"**The power basis has dimension 2 (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2PowerBasis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2PowerBasis","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2AlgebraDimension.lean#L43-L46","doc":"The **power basis `{1, σ}` of `H_2(q) = AdjoinRoot (h2Poly q)`**\n(sorry-free), of dimension `2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2Poly_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2Poly_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2AlgebraDimension.lean#L40-L41","doc":"**`h2Poly ≠ 0` (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2Poly_natDegree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2Poly_natDegree","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2AlgebraDimension.lean#L36-L38","doc":"**`h2Poly` has degree 2 (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2Poly_monic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2Poly_monic","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2AlgebraDimension.lean#L32-L34","doc":"**`h2Poly` is monic (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2Poly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2Poly","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2AlgebraDimension.lean#L27-L30","doc":"The **`H_2(q)` Hecke quadratic** `X² - (q-1)X - q`.  Its root is the\nHecke generator `σ` (`σ² = (q-1)σ + q`); the quotient\n`K[X]/(h2Poly)` is the Iwahori–Hecke algebra `H_2(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}